# Sync-conflict copies. iCloud and Dropbox resolve a clash by writing
# "name 2.ext" beside the original. These have broken the Docker build once by
# shadowing a real directory, and a copy of .env would not be matched by the
# rule above — so they are excluded by name here as well.
* 2
* 2.*
